      "description": "Icon and text routes with a filled current state; two columns on mobile.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-rail\"><nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Điều hướng chính\"><a href=\"/dashboard\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"11\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"18\" width=\"7\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/></svg>Tổng quan</a><a href=\"/integrations\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"7\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 3v4M2 12v4m20-4v4m-14-4h1m6 0h1m-7 4h6\"/></svg>Bot &amp; API</a><a href=\"/users\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 21v-2a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v2m2-14a4 4 0 0 1 0 8m1 3a5 5 0 0 1 3 3\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg>Người dùng</a><a href=\"/account\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"/></svg>Tài khoản</a></nav></div>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{background:var(--pine,#173f35);color:var(--surface,#fff);padding:22px;font-family:'Be Vietnam',system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.ds-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:8px;color:#cadcd1;text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem;min-height:48px}.ds-nav a:hover{background:#244f42;color:white}.ds-nav a[aria-current=page]{background:#315b47;color:white}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d4e8c4;outline-offset:4px}.ds-nav svg{width:21px;height:21px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px}.ds-nav a{padding:10px 12px;font-size:.78rem;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;min-height:42px}.ds-nav svg{width:18px;height:18px}}"
